> I was wondering if it is possible to include weights when data are ordinal?

Yes, but only when using pairwise ML estimation.

> cfa (specified_model, data = cfa_dataset,  std.lv <http://std.lv> = TRUE, meanstructure = T,

>      estimator = "PML", missing = "pairwise", ordered = TRUE, sampling.weights = "wgt")

Of course, PML also makes better missing= options available:
https://doi.org/10.1111/bmsp.12243
(see syntax examples in Appendix E of their supplemental file)

